    <p style="font-family:Poppins,sans-serif;color:#374151;line-height:1.8;margin-bottom:1.25rem;">Three patterns emerge: weekend support gaps (critical for F&amp;B where peak days are Friday–Sunday), redemption glitches at the counter, and limited regional language support. These aren't dealbreakers for every restaurant — but if something goes wrong during your Friday dinner rush, you'll feel every one of them.</p>

